From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: krane <chris@krane.dev>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 16:09:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(lock): report the lock state over IPC

Port of pctrade/end4-pC dc2ca2600ee6: none (krane-only)
https://github.com/pctrade/end4-pC/tree/dc2ca2600ee6d7852bf0ac91361db8e510f90a74
Problem: krane-ii-settings boot-check waits for the first unlock before asking to keep new display settings.
Port: krane-only
Drop when: the lock IPC handler reports its state upstream.
---
 .../quickshell/ii/modules/common/panels/lock/LockScreen.qml  | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/panels/lock/LockScreen.qml b/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/panels/lock/LockScreen.qml
index cb78450b..fc1364fc 100644
--- a/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/panels/lock/LockScreen.qml
+++ b/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/panels/lock/LockScreen.qml
@@ -109,6 +109,11 @@ Scope {
         function focus(): void {
             lockContext.shouldReFocus();
         }
+        // For krane-ii-settings boot-check, which waits for the first unlock
+        // before asking to keep new display settings.
+        function isLocked(): bool {
+            return GlobalStates.screenLocked;
+        }
     }
 
     GlobalShortcut {
